1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:02,855
Catch! Catch the ball!

2
00:00:02,855 --> 00:00:05,059
Got it! My turn now!

3
00:00:05,059 --> 00:00:07,889
Throw it high, Tinku bhaiya! Higher!

4
00:00:08,589 --> 00:00:12,160
Look! The first star is out in the sky!

5
00:00:12,060 --> 00:00:15,224
That star is twinkling at me!

6
00:00:15,324 --> 00:00:19,114
The sun is setting. It'll be dark soon.

7
00:00:19,015 --> 00:00:21,625
Just five more minutes!

8
00:00:21,625 --> 00:00:22,725
Woof! Woof!

9
00:00:22,725 --> 00:00:25,859
Moti! Where are you running with the ball?

10
00:00:27,559 --> 00:00:29,635
Moti! Moti! Where are you?

11
00:00:29,934 --> 00:00:34,420
Tinku bhaiya... it's so dark now. I'm scared.

12
00:00:34,420 --> 00:00:36,715
Don't be scared, Golu. I'm right here!

13
00:00:38,015 --> 00:00:40,225
Wh-who said that? Hoo-hoo?

14
00:00:40,225 --> 00:00:44,534
That's an owl! Owls stay awake at night and sleep in the day.

15
00:00:45,234 --> 00:00:47,854
Shhh! Something moved in that bush!

16
00:00:49,954 --> 00:00:51,784
G-g-ghost!

17
00:00:51,484 --> 00:00:53,159
Help! A ghost!

18
00:00:54,060 --> 00:00:56,439
Bhaiya, the ghost will eat us!

19
00:00:56,439 --> 00:00:59,195
It's coming this way!

20
00:00:59,895 --> 00:01:02,619
Wait... this ghost has four legs!

21
00:01:02,619 --> 00:01:05,349
And... its tail is wagging!

22
00:01:05,250 --> 00:01:08,415
A ghost with a tail? Do ghosts have tails?

23
00:01:08,515 --> 00:01:11,135
Come on, let's look with the torch.

24
00:01:13,034 --> 00:01:14,849
Hey! It's Moti!

25
00:01:14,650 --> 00:01:16,129
Woof! Woof! Woof!

26
00:01:16,230 --> 00:01:20,905
Sharma aunty's bedsheet blew off and fell on Moti!

27
00:01:20,805 --> 00:01:23,435
Ha ha ha! Moti the ghost! Moti the ghost!

28
00:01:23,534 --> 00:01:27,730
Poor Moti! He got stuck in the sheet and got scared too.

29
00:01:27,930 --> 00:01:31,424
Let's hang the sheet back on the line.

30
00:01:31,325 --> 00:01:33,325
I'll hang it! Me! Me!

31
00:01:34,825 --> 00:01:37,609
Oh Golu! Now YOU are the ghost!

32
00:01:37,510 --> 00:01:39,474
Boo! I'm Golu the ghost!

33
00:01:40,974 --> 00:01:45,030
Now straight home! Mummy must be waiting.

34
00:01:45,030 --> 00:01:47,935
But first... a big hug for Moti!

35
00:01:47,834 --> 00:01:48,555
Woof!

36
00:01:49,254 --> 00:01:54,305
Next time: Golu's sneeze so giant, everything flies away!

37
00:01:54,305 --> 00:01:56,209
Bye-bye, friends!

38
00:01:56,010 --> 00:01:57,540
Bye-bye!
